-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Wik\" title=\"Jessica Wik\">Jessica Wik</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/IFK_Norrk%C3%B6ping_(women)\" title=\"IFK Norrköping (women)\">Norrköping</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Seasonal_awards\">Seasonal awards</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2025_Damallsvenskan&amp;action=edit&amp;section=19\" title=\"Edit section: Seasonal awards\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1368532237\">.mw-parser-output .hatnote{font-style:italic}.mw-parser-output div.hatnote{padding-left:1.6em;margin-bottom:0.5em}.mw-parser-output .hatnote i{font-style:normal}.mw-parser-output .hatnote+.mw-empty-elt+.hatnote{margin-top:-0.5em}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .hatnote{display:none!important}}</style><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Main article: <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_Awards&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Damallsvenskan Awards (page does not exist)\">Damallsvenskan Awards</a></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"background-color:#eedd82\">2025 Damallsvenskan Awards<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-30\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-30\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>26<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background-color: #eedd82\">Award\n</th>\n<th style=\"background-color: #eedd82\">Winner\n</th>\n<th style=\"background-color: #eedd82\">Club\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Most Valuable Player\n</th>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sweden\" title=\"Sweden\"><img alt=\"Sweden\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Felicia_Schr%C3%B6der\" title=\"Felicia Schröder\">Felicia Schröder</a>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/BK_H%C3%A4cken_FF\" title=\"BK Häcken FF\">Häcken</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Youth Prize\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Breakthrough of the Year\n</th>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sweden\" title=\"Sweden\"><img alt=\"Sweden\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Smilla_Holmberg\" title=\"Smilla Holmberg\">Smilla Holmberg</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_Fotboll_(women)\" title=\"Hammarby Fotboll (women)\">Hammarby</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Goal of the Year\n</th>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sweden\" title=\"Sweden\"><img alt=\"Sweden\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Anna_Anveg%C3%A5rd\" title=\"Anna Anvegård\">Anna Anvegård</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/BK_H%C3%A4cken_FF\" title=\"BK Häcken FF\">Häcken</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"background-color:#eedd82\">Team of the Year\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Goalkeeper of the Year\n</th>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sweden\" title=\"Sweden\"><img alt=\"Sweden\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/40px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4c/Flag_of_Sweden.svg/60px-Flag_of_Sweden.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1600\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jennifer_Falk\" title=\"Jennifer Falk\">Jennifer Falk</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/BK_H%C3%A4cken_FF\" title=\"BK Häcken FF\">Häcken</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Defender of the Year\n</th>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Norway\" title=\"Norway\"><img alt=\"Norway\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Flag_of_Norway.svg/40px-Flag_of_Norway.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Flag_of_Norway.svg/60px-Flag_of_Norway.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-widt