lite_Football_Women\" title=\"Elite Football Women\">Elite Football Women</a>. 8 May 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Felicia+Schr%C3%B6der+%C3%A4r+M%C3%A5nadens+Spelare+i+mars&amp;rft.pub=Elite+Football+Women&amp;rft.date=2025-05-08&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fefd.se%2Ffelicia-schroder-ar-manadens-spelare-i-april%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2025+Damallsvenskan\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-25\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-25\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1 cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://efd.se/beata-olsson-ar-manadens-spelare-i-maj/\">\"Beata Olsson är Månadens Spelare i maj\"</a> &#91;Beata Olsson is Player of the Month for May&#93; (in Swedish). <a href=\"/wiki/Elite_Football_Women\" title=\"Elite Football Women\">Elite Football Women</a>. 5 June 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Beata+Olsson+%C3%A4r+M%C3%A5nadens+Spelare+i+maj&amp;rft.pub=Elite+Football+Women&amp;rft.date=2025-06-05&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fefd.se%2Fbeata-olsson-ar-manadens-spelare-i-maj%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2025+Damallsvenskan\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-26\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-26\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1 cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.mynewsdesk.com/se/elitfotbolldam/pressreleases/mff-s