+utses+till+M%C3%A5nadens+Spelare+f%C3%B6r+andra+g%C3%A5ngen+i+rad&amp;rft.pub=Elite+Football+Women&amp;rft.date=2025-09-11&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fefd.se%2Fmia-persson-utses-till-manadens-spelare-for-andra-gangen-i-rad%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2025+Damallsvenskan\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-28\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-28\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1 cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://efd.se/mimmi-wahlstrom-ar-manadens-spelare-i-september/\">\"Mimmi Wahlström är Månadens Spelare i september\"</a> &#91;Mimmi Wahlström is Player of the Month for September&#93; (in Swedish). <a href=\"/wiki/Elite_Football_Women\" title=\"Elite Football Women\">Elite Football Women</a>. 9 October 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Mimmi+Wahlstr%C3%B6m+%C3%A4r+M%C3%A5nadens+Spelare+i+september&amp;rft.pub=Elite+Football+Women&amp;rft.date=2025-10-09&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fefd.se%2Fmimmi-wahlstrom-ar-manadens-spelare-i-september%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2025+Damallsvenskan\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-29\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-29\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1 cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://efd.se/anna-anvegard-utses-till-manadens-spelare-i-oktober/\">\"Anna Anvegård utses till Månadens Spelare i oktober\"</a> &#91;Anna Anvegård is named Player of the Month for October&#93; (in Swedish). <a href=\"/wiki/Elite_Football_Women\" title=\"Elite Football Women\">Elite Football Women</a>. 30 October 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Anna+Anveg%C3%A5rd+utses+till+M%C3%A5nadens+Spelare+i+oktober&amp;rft.pub=Elite+Football+Women&amp;rft.date=2025-10-30&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fefd.se%2Fanna-anvegard-utses-till-manadens-spelare-i-oktober%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2025+Damallsvenskan\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-30\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-30\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1 cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.aftonbladet.se/senastenytt/ttsport/sport/a/j09m10/schroder-utsedd-till-arets-mvp-i-damallsvenskan\">\"Schröder utsedd till Årets MVP i Damallsvenskan\"</a> &#91;Schröder named MVP of the Year in the Damallsvenskan&#93; (in Swedish). <a href=\"/wiki/Aftonbladet\" title=\"Aftonbladet\">Aftonbladet</a>. 23 November 2025.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Schr%C3%B6der+utsedd+till+%C3%85rets+MVP+i+Damallsvenskan&amp;rft.pub=Aftonbladet&amp;rft.date=2025-11-23&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aftonbladet.se%2Fsenastenytt%2Fttsport%2Fsport%2Fa%2Fj09m10%2Fschroder-utsedd-till-arets-mvp-i-damallsvenskan&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2025+Damallsvenskan\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"External_links\">External links</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2025_Damallsvenskan&amp;action=edit&amp;section=21\" tit